# Prototype is mock-only

This repository produces **DEMO** Angular wireframes. Treat every change as disposable-looking but contract-faithful stub work.

- Load data from the current app’s `src/assets/mock/` (or in-repo fixtures). Do not add HTTP clients to customer or production hosts.
- No secrets, tokens, SSO, or production URLs in code, docs, env files, or Automations.
- No real employee, customer, or PHI. Use `EXAMPLE —` role labels and fictional names.
- Keep the DEMO / mock-data banner visible on primary routes.
- If a screen has no stub, ship an empty/error state — do not invent a live fetch to fill it.
- New concepts live under `apps/<slug>/`. Do not overwrite `apps/examples/project-health/` unless the user explicitly says to extend that example.
